  "slug": "claude-discord-status",
  "name": "Claude Discord Status",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Show your Claude Code status in Discord with Rich Presence.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **5 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `configure` (Set up and configure the Discord Rich Presence plugin)\n- **Hooks** (5): `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`, `PostToolUse`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `CwdChanged`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-discord-status@claude-community` from `QuantumInkDev/claude-discord-status`.",
